  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed conversion of the dwellinghouse into three flats and sub division of the rear garden into three separate amenity areas would result in an over intensification of the use of the site and a poor standard of living accommodation, to the detriment of the residential amenities of the future occupiers and the character and appearance of the property and area, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2023), policies D3 D (7) and (11) and D6 of The London Plan (2021), policies DM1, DM26 and DM27 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), the Mayor of London Supplementary Planning Guidance Housing (2016), and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010)."
